{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Messages that the person did not write, as the hgs journal marks them (event) and as desktop, Android and iOS Activity present them (presentation). `prompt` is the native prompt text; `event` is the served journal row. A notice's label names a declared sender: an envelope is a label in the text, not proof of who sent it.",
  "cases": [
